                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "50511771",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561198265772272",
                            "num_reviews": 6,
                            "playtime_forever": 84,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 82,
                            "last_played": 1557492659
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I am actually teaching English in China just like the character in the game, therefore, this game was quite appealing to me. The entire game can be completed in 1 hour and I really hope more games like this will be made. \n\nThe words are useful for someone at an HSK 1 level (The 34 vocabulary words are related to greetings, living space, office, shop, etc.). The correct \"pinyin\" is needed in order to defeat the Chinese character monster. I think this game could be improved if a Chinese person spoke the words every time you attack the monsters. It would be amazing if someone could play this game and at least mimic the correct pronunciation of a few Chinese words. \n\nFor $0.99, it was well worth it.",
